Subject: [STAGING PATCH] MT6878 MD: wire real native genpd ON from first-OFF

Apply after frozen native MD/shared-provider, ACK30 and0187 wakeup.
Default off. Submit real FLIGHT(true), check only defined a0 using the
matched ATF inner contract, then check TOP. No UFS calibration provider
is allowed. Admit the sole genuine CCCI consumer from OFF and execute
voltage/sync, TOP ungate, FLIGHT(false), isolation/PWR_ON/ACK30, reverse
bus release and actual ON readback. No invented execution-inhibit gate.
POWER/0, transport and lifecycle are separate, unvalidated operations.

